{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#880","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#880","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#880\",\"parent_revision\":\"4d463d2ca40c9f904efa780eded94e4f98119722b0d5f96ae4dddf220e5e7468\",\"root_revision\":\"4d463d2ca40c9f904efa780eded94e4f98119722b0d5f96ae4dddf220e5e7468\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nThe current `vm-scenario-runner` skill dispatches a pilot and blocks synchronously until completion (score 2/5). Restructure to dispatch the pilot and return immediately. Inspector scheduling and completion monitoring happen via the scheduled task, not by blocking the orchestrator. Also remove the prohibition on radio-control during active runs; replace with \\\"schedule inspector checks during long-running pilot tasks.\\\"\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the codebase**, I want to **restructure `vm-scenario-runner` to async dispatch** so that **the code is cleaner and more maintainable**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: PRD-vm-flightsimulator-v2\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-20\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"31432251549e20bc4d606bfd4b14702dcaa726dc45f18d3ba2cfa8864d9d1d48\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVDCRvg\"}"}